WEBVTT

00:55.250 --> 00:58.600
We lost 300 gold pieces,
thanks to your meddling.

00:58.600 --> 01:01.130
We won't go back empty-handed.

01:01.390 --> 01:04.830
If your hands are so empty,
will you hold this?

01:32.780 --> 01:36.350
Is it true they hired you
for only twenty gold pieces?

01:36.350 --> 01:37.020
Yes.

01:37.810 --> 01:42.230
The sword we stole was a treasure
given to them by the Shogun.

01:42.230 --> 01:46.440
And they'll only pay twenty
pieces to get it back?

01:48.240 --> 01:49.410
Ridiculous!

01:49.410 --> 01:51.380
They're a poor, small clan.

01:51.670 --> 01:55.440
Trying to swindle 300 pieces
for a sword is asking too much.

01:57.200 --> 01:59.010
Shut up! Damn you!

02:02.450 --> 02:04.390
Looks like a nasty
storm's brewing...

02:05.060 --> 02:06.540
Can't waste my time here!

03:19.880 --> 03:21.840
Oh, I'm sorry for you.

03:22.210 --> 03:24.320
That was one hell of a storm!

03:24.320 --> 03:27.140
No shit! My roof got blown off
and it scared my wife so bad...

03:27.140 --> 03:29.120
...that she went into labour.

03:29.120 --> 03:30.600
It was really something.

03:30.950 --> 03:33.000
That's your seventh kid, right?

03:33.000 --> 03:34.450
Nope, the ninth.

03:34.450 --> 03:36.610
Holy...! You must
really love your wife!

03:39.360 --> 03:43.360
Isn't that Sakichi's daughter
from Shimoda Village?

03:43.810 --> 03:45.590
What's with her?

03:51.710 --> 03:53.120
Hey... What's wrong?!

03:58.850 --> 04:01.000
All... dead...

04:02.260 --> 04:05.180
Everybody's dead.

04:05.450 --> 04:07.260
Dead?!

04:07.260 --> 04:11.680
Plague... Plague did it...

04:17.250 --> 04:19.150
My God!

04:19.420 --> 04:22.150
This area's off limits!
No one goes through here!

04:22.150 --> 04:25.860
This highway's closed
until the epidemic is over.

04:25.860 --> 04:28.160
Epidemic?!
The hell with that!

04:30.790 --> 04:31.710
What is it?

04:31.710 --> 04:35.400
Sir, my scout saw a
strange group of men...

04:35.400 --> 04:39.670
...ride toward Shimoda
Village late last night.

04:39.910 --> 04:42.070
It might have something
to do with this epidemic...

04:42.070 --> 04:45.630
...so I came to tell you,
Chamberlain.

04:45.630 --> 04:48.620
Meaning what?
That they spread a plague...

04:48.620 --> 04:51.310
...as they passed
through the village?

04:51.310 --> 04:53.930
Ridiculous!
Why would they do that?

04:54.650 --> 04:56.440
Something's fishy.

04:56.770 --> 04:58.050
Leave it alone.

05:02.370 --> 05:04.440
On second thought, we can't.

05:04.440 --> 05:06.780
This is the order to all
of you in the Koga ninja team.

05:06.780 --> 05:10.060
Go to Shimoda Village and
find out what really happened.

05:10.060 --> 05:10.630
Sir!

05:10.950 --> 05:14.460
One more thing. If any of
your people get infected...

05:15.220 --> 05:16.970
Understood, sir.

05:17.460 --> 05:19.960
The first group will follow the
Shirakawa River from the north.

05:20.270 --> 05:22.840
The second will cross
Taro Pass from the west.

05:23.130 --> 05:26.470
You'll reach Shimoda Village
in about an hour. Understand?

05:26.470 --> 05:30.970
Hikoza saw them. There were
only eight. No match for us.

05:32.110 --> 05:33.970
Our real enemy is
this disease.

05:35.050 --> 05:36.590
True.

05:47.390 --> 05:48.610
Kagero...

05:56.490 --> 05:59.380
You intend to leave
me behind, Hanza?

05:59.750 --> 06:02.690
You have your
own duties, don't you?

06:02.930 --> 06:06.380
Poison tasting is very
important. Don't forget that.

06:06.710 --> 06:10.720
While our lord is away from his
domain, the work isn't necessary.

06:10.720 --> 06:15.140
Until he returns...
I am one of the Koga ninja!

06:16.420 --> 06:18.140
I can't take you.

06:18.480 --> 06:20.790
You could all be
killed out there.

06:21.030 --> 06:22.150
How can I...

06:22.880 --> 06:25.400
...just sit and
wait here alone?!

06:41.720 --> 06:45.340
Kagero's gotten
even more beautiful.

06:45.900 --> 06:48.080
All the more
reason to pity her.

06:48.080 --> 06:50.840
It's her destiny.
She must hate it.

06:51.190 --> 06:53.910
Enough. Where are
Hikoza and the others?

06:54.320 --> 06:57.700
They were right behind us.
I'll have a look.

07:12.490 --> 07:14.660
Hey! What are you doing?

07:19.050 --> 07:20.330
What the...?!

07:46.940 --> 07:48.180
There!

08:09.950 --> 08:11.090
Shit!

08:33.020 --> 08:37.160
Kagero, get back and
tell the chamberlain!

08:39.160 --> 08:41.870
Go now!

09:58.300 --> 10:01.780
Just be quiet and you'll
live a little longer.

10:02.180 --> 10:06.000
Either way's fine by me.
Could be interesting to fuck a dead girl.

10:08.950 --> 10:10.480
That's better.

10:23.520 --> 10:25.770
I'm busy here.
Get lost!

10:26.400 --> 10:28.000
Didn't you hear me?

10:41.240 --> 10:46.180
The highway's out and I had to
make a detour but now I'm lost.

10:46.180 --> 10:48.950
Can you tell me
how to get to Kakio?

10:51.640 --> 10:52.920
Not very friendly...

10:53.270 --> 10:56.460
I think I told
you to get lost!

11:10.550 --> 11:11.780
Forget it.

11:11.780 --> 11:15.480
Once I get rid of this meddler
I'll take my time killing you.

11:18.700 --> 11:23.760
What's wrong? Sorry you
didn't run when I told you to?

11:25.070 --> 11:29.410
No, just thinking...
About your body.

11:30.700 --> 11:35.040
Your body can't be
rock hard everywhere!

11:39.550 --> 11:40.630
Move it!

11:58.830 --> 11:59.230
Tessai!

12:04.530 --> 12:08.240
You are indeed a sorry sight.
But no need to pursue him so.

12:08.740 --> 12:10.090
I'll kill him!

12:10.090 --> 12:13.470
No, you shan't.
Don't forget our mission.

12:13.470 --> 12:17.030
Consider my word
as Lord Genma's order.

12:17.310 --> 12:18.250
Understood?

12:19.600 --> 12:21.210
Shall we go?

12:34.130 --> 12:36.560
Who was that freak?

12:37.560 --> 12:40.280
Forget it. I don't want
to see him again, anyway.

12:41.220 --> 12:42.750
I'm grateful to you.

12:43.570 --> 12:45.530
I am Kagero of the Koga ninja.

12:46.830 --> 12:50.050
Jubei. Kibagami Jubei.

12:50.470 --> 12:52.040
Are you all right?

12:52.600 --> 12:54.640
I don't need your concern!

12:55.910 --> 12:59.140
The town of Kakio is in the west.
Our paths part here.

13:40.130 --> 13:41.410
Who is it?

13:41.630 --> 13:44.170
Kagero of the Koga, sir.

13:44.550 --> 13:45.840
What's wrong?

13:46.170 --> 13:48.600
Twenty ninja led by Hanza
attempted to infiltrate...

13:48.600 --> 13:53.350
...Shimoda Village a little
while ago. They were wiped out.

13:53.890 --> 13:57.380
Really? All of them?
Who killed them?

13:57.380 --> 14:01.360
A very formidable opponent.
Beyond that, I cannot say.

14:01.840 --> 14:04.270
Useless, all of them.

14:08.610 --> 14:11.180
And you're the only survivor?

14:11.770 --> 14:12.370
Yes, sir.

14:12.370 --> 14:15.650
Until we learn who he is
and what he's up to...

14:15.650 --> 14:18.960
...we can't risk sending our
men to that plague village.

14:19.790 --> 14:23.190
The first task at hand is
to go back and find that out.

14:23.190 --> 14:25.380
We'll figure out what
to do later.

14:25.640 --> 14:26.800
Now go...

15:08.920 --> 15:10.380
Oh, hi...

15:12.230 --> 15:15.230
I know the way now, so...

15:15.230 --> 15:19.300
No, you're going the wrong way.
The river to hell...

15:20.870 --> 15:22.360
...is this way!

15:34.780 --> 15:40.500
Ow... Okay, it's out of your
system. Are we even now?

15:41.220 --> 15:43.750
Not yet. I still owe you.

15:45.830 --> 15:47.630
That's just excessive.

15:47.630 --> 15:52.010
If we keep this up,
one of us is going to die.

15:52.570 --> 15:54.230
One of us?

15:55.370 --> 15:59.020
There's no reason we
should kill each other.

16:03.140 --> 16:06.020
If you're not going
to end this... I will!

16:06.860 --> 16:08.360
Like hell!

16:17.980 --> 16:22.500
Strange skill you have.
But it can't hurt my body.

16:23.960 --> 16:25.000
Seems that way.

16:39.240 --> 16:43.480
What's wrong, monster?
Your skin's starting to crumble!

16:46.190 --> 16:48.060
Die!

17:23.220 --> 17:28.610
Splendid! Your sword flew
swift as the wind itself...

17:28.610 --> 17:32.530
...and slashed your enemy
like a cyclone's touch.

17:33.350 --> 17:37.130
He was no match for you.
Why don't you join me?

17:37.130 --> 17:42.310
Your skills will be of great help
for me to fight the likes of him.

17:42.310 --> 17:47.240
You're joking. Who'd want to
fight a monster like him again?

17:48.090 --> 17:51.140
You'll have to.
They won't leave you alone.

17:51.140 --> 17:56.050
You've just killed one
of the Eight Devils of Kimon.

17:56.710 --> 18:01.150
You didn't beat
him by yourself, though.

18:02.200 --> 18:06.590
That Koga ninja woman...
Interesting technique she uses.

18:23.410 --> 18:27.270
Lord Genma. Everything
is proceeding as planned.

18:33.290 --> 18:37.150
It arrives from the Shogun of
the Dark by six tomorrow evening.

18:39.150 --> 18:43.290
Very well.
Write to him in return.

18:44.100 --> 18:49.690
"We return in three days.
There's nothing to worry about".

18:50.120 --> 18:51.350
At once.

18:56.260 --> 18:58.680
Isn't Tessai back yet?

18:58.680 --> 19:04.080
Benisato went to look for him.
We're all alone.

19:04.880 --> 19:08.950
Yurimaru...
I've always loved you.

19:18.010 --> 19:20.790
Don't push your luck, Zakuro.

19:20.790 --> 19:24.680
You're of no interest to me.
Now go and stand watch.

19:35.490 --> 19:37.230
So, it's true.

19:38.030 --> 19:40.700
May your dreams be pleasant
ones in Genma's arms.

19:41.060 --> 19:45.340
However, Yurimaru, Genma makes
love to both men and women.

19:45.860 --> 19:49.700
Do you know he makes
love to Benisato?

19:49.700 --> 19:51.350
Apparently not.

20:40.690 --> 20:44.430
Where are you headed?

20:45.360 --> 20:48.180
Nowhere in particular. You?

20:48.690 --> 20:54.940
I'm looking for somebody and
you look exactly like him, so...

20:55.470 --> 20:59.690
Strangers can look alike.
I'm Kibagami Jubei, a wanderer...

21:12.010 --> 21:13.910
It was most
certainly your face.

21:14.290 --> 21:18.390
Tessai was able to make
an impression of it.

21:34.680 --> 21:36.560
Just leave me the hell alone!

21:45.300 --> 21:47.510
A cast-off skin.

21:47.510 --> 21:51.130
She shed it like
a snake and escaped.

21:52.870 --> 21:55.870
A gang of freaks,
one and all.

21:58.120 --> 22:01.880
You've no obligation. I just
didn't want you to die yet.

22:03.240 --> 22:05.880
Who are these
Eight Devils of Kimon?

22:06.530 --> 22:08.920
A group of ninja who
work for the Shogun of the Dark.

22:08.920 --> 22:10.890
You know of the
Shogun of the Dark?

22:11.250 --> 22:16.160
He wants to rebuild the House of
Toyotomi, the ex-ruler of Japan.

22:16.160 --> 22:18.160
He has 16 lords behind him and
is trying to expand his influence.

22:18.160 --> 22:21.650
The most dangerous enemy
of the Tokugawa Shogunate.

22:21.650 --> 22:25.760
His power is supported in the
shadows by the Eight Devils.

22:25.760 --> 22:28.910
What are they up to
here in Mochizuki?

22:29.510 --> 22:33.670
That's what I came here to
find out. It's a tough job.

22:34.140 --> 22:37.410
Why don't you work for me,
for 100 gold pieces?

22:38.590 --> 22:41.670
A Tokugawa spy wants
to hire a ninja?

22:43.210 --> 22:45.620
I'm afraid I have no choice.
It's an emergency.

22:45.620 --> 22:49.260
Only I managed to make
it here to Mochizuki.

22:49.260 --> 22:51.900
The Eight Devils killed everyone
else in my party on our way here.

22:51.900 --> 22:54.680
I need your
help by all means!

22:55.420 --> 22:58.510
You'll never get away from them.

22:58.510 --> 23:00.730
You'll have to fight
them sooner or later.

23:00.730 --> 23:04.190
Join me. You can kill two
birds with one stone, right?

23:04.750 --> 23:08.700
I don't think so. Now why
don't you just leave me alone?

23:11.190 --> 23:13.450
I see. Too bad.

23:14.260 --> 23:16.080
Such a pity...

23:18.760 --> 23:23.290
You'll lose
your precious life.

23:23.870 --> 23:24.960
You're stubborn.

23:25.250 --> 23:29.120
No, what I speak of is literally
a matter of life or death for you.

23:29.120 --> 23:33.600
You see, the point of that
throwing star was poisoned.

23:33.600 --> 23:36.680
It won't kill you instantly,
but in a day and a night...

23:36.680 --> 23:38.980
...when it starts to work,
nothing can stop it.

23:40.360 --> 23:44.890
Unless you get the antidote.
And only I know what it is.

23:44.890 --> 23:48.360
Work for me and I'll tell you
about the antidote. And you'll get...

23:48.360 --> 23:50.490
...the hundred gold pieces
when the job is done.

23:51.320 --> 23:53.150
You're bluffing.

23:58.450 --> 24:00.370
I speak the truth.

24:00.370 --> 24:03.870
Tell me now.
What's the antidote?

24:04.230 --> 24:08.450
Not until you work for me.
Kill me and you've killed yourself!

24:14.210 --> 24:16.470
Now you'll need the
antidote for yourself.

24:16.720 --> 24:19.710
Poor boy...
You've so much to learn.

24:19.710 --> 24:22.480
That isn't the
one that hit you.

24:23.220 --> 24:25.980
I threw that one away.

24:29.230 --> 24:30.030
Shit!

24:31.210 --> 24:35.530
Kibagami Jubei...
You've lost... Amateur!

24:36.800 --> 24:40.540
My name is Dakuan.
How do you do?

24:45.160 --> 24:46.250
So, Benisato...

24:46.250 --> 24:50.460
This man, Kibagami Jubei, is a
remnant of the Shogunate's spies?

24:50.950 --> 24:52.340
Possibly.

24:52.340 --> 24:54.080
Why didn't you kill him?

24:54.630 --> 24:56.210
Someone interfered.

24:56.210 --> 24:57.470
No excuses!

25:00.560 --> 25:04.660
If he's a government spy,
he'll show up here soon.

25:05.020 --> 25:06.980
Be sure to kill him this time!

25:07.250 --> 25:09.740
I don't need your
advice to do that.

25:09.980 --> 25:16.240
Yurimaru... I'll tell Genma
about this in bed. Do you mind?

25:17.950 --> 25:19.240
Not at all.

25:24.490 --> 25:26.210
Jubei...

25:26.210 --> 25:30.710
There's something
I've been wondering.

25:31.150 --> 25:34.510
Are you, by any chance,
the ninja who killed...

25:34.510 --> 25:37.220
...the chief retainers of the
Yamashiro clan five years ago?

25:38.080 --> 25:41.720
He was supposedly a
master swordsman, like you.

25:44.750 --> 25:47.360
The retainers who were killed
had gorged themselves with gold...

25:47.360 --> 25:51.080
...they secretly dug
out of a hidden mine.

25:51.080 --> 25:53.710
The ninja must have killed
them by order of the lord...

25:53.710 --> 25:57.230
...who wanted to report to
the government about the mine.

25:57.230 --> 25:59.480
Because if the government found
the hidden gold mine first...

25:59.480 --> 26:02.150
...the lord would have
lost his fief.

26:02.890 --> 26:07.470
But does that ninja know that
after the retainers were killed...

26:07.470 --> 26:10.000
...the government received
no report about the mine?

26:10.900 --> 26:15.160
Why? If a government spy
like you knows all that...

26:15.160 --> 26:18.010
...then why don't
you do something?

26:18.320 --> 26:23.240
No... Even the government can't
move without definite evidence.

26:23.240 --> 26:27.320
Our spies tried many times
to infiltrate the clan...

26:27.320 --> 26:29.990
...to find evidence,
but none returned alive.

26:29.990 --> 26:31.350
The Shogun of the Dark...

26:31.350 --> 26:35.030
He stopped them by
using the Kimon ninja.

26:35.460 --> 26:39.030
Why is the Shogun of the Dark
helping the Yamashiro clan?

26:39.030 --> 26:42.990
Simple. He wants the
gold mine for himself.

26:44.540 --> 26:49.860
Do you know how he found the
gold mine before the government?

26:50.150 --> 26:52.760
Because somebody
gave him the information.

26:52.760 --> 26:56.550
Somebody who was the leader of
the ninja of the Yamashiro clan.

26:57.560 --> 26:59.260
Himuro... Genma?!

27:00.780 --> 27:02.260
Precisely.

27:03.460 --> 27:07.270
I doubt that. He isn't
in this world anymore.

27:07.270 --> 27:10.940
No, he's still very much alive.
And you'll see him soon.

27:10.940 --> 27:14.270
Himuro Genma is the boss
of the Kimon monsters.

27:14.560 --> 27:15.270
What?!

27:15.520 --> 27:17.370
Shh! Not so loud!

27:17.370 --> 27:19.300
You can't trick me
the same way again!

27:19.300 --> 27:23.280
Don't be hasty.
You'll soon know the truth.

27:23.620 --> 27:29.430
But you must admit that you
and he share a strange fate.

27:34.760 --> 27:37.580
Stop! You'd kill
your own friend?!

27:37.580 --> 27:38.860
The lord orders it!

27:38.860 --> 27:41.200
As did our leader!

27:42.630 --> 27:44.100
It's a trick!

27:44.100 --> 27:47.280
Now that we know the traitors' secret...

27:47.280 --> 27:49.350
...they want to get rid of us
by making us kill each other.

27:49.350 --> 27:53.510
This is a trap for all of us.
Shinkuro, believe me!

27:54.260 --> 27:56.360
Jubei... Forgive me.

27:56.360 --> 27:57.860
Shinkuro!

27:58.700 --> 28:00.280
His word...

28:00.280 --> 28:01.200
...is law!

28:40.720 --> 28:45.810
I avenged Shinkuro and the others
myself. Genma can't be alive.

28:46.870 --> 28:51.250
We're getting close. This place
is thick with ghosts and blood.

28:51.470 --> 28:54.500
Beyond lies hell itself.

28:58.200 --> 29:02.350
Heaven must have sent
this mist to help us.

29:17.410 --> 29:18.180
Hey!

29:26.610 --> 29:28.720
Goddamn mist!

29:52.470 --> 29:56.300
How could he have
dodged Shijima's claw?

30:24.240 --> 30:25.130
Who are you?

30:25.520 --> 30:29.030
I heard a voice
chanting the sutra.

30:29.030 --> 30:32.600
I was praying for
the dead villagers.

30:33.370 --> 30:37.180
Don't you know an epidemic
is plaguing this village?

30:38.720 --> 30:43.310
Poor soul! You'll never
leave this village alive.

30:43.800 --> 30:47.600
Here now, let us go to
the land of Buddha together.

30:53.470 --> 30:57.190
Have you seen a
travelling monk here?

30:57.970 --> 31:03.380
He'll meet Buddha soon enough.
I'll send him there.

31:03.910 --> 31:05.880
Such a benevolent nun...

31:14.050 --> 31:16.350
Shit!
Another cast-off skin!

31:26.410 --> 31:30.330
Gone... He uses
a strange technique...

31:41.080 --> 31:43.540
As do you.
Very strange indeed!

31:52.550 --> 31:59.560
Answer me. Are there any
others with you besides the monk?

32:00.380 --> 32:03.760
Of course.
And not just ten or twenty.

32:03.760 --> 32:07.070
You can send a snake for each
and it won't be enough.

32:08.540 --> 32:09.570
Liar!

32:10.380 --> 32:13.380
All right!
I'll tell you the truth.

32:14.240 --> 32:17.870
There's two. One's the
travelling monk. The other...

32:18.090 --> 32:19.580
...is right behind you.

32:21.870 --> 32:25.080
Lose the snakes.
Down to the last one!

32:30.880 --> 32:32.420
You'll be dead soon.

32:36.620 --> 32:37.800
Get rid of them!

32:56.220 --> 32:58.240
Now it's your turn to answer.

32:58.570 --> 33:01.580
What are you doing
in this village? Talk!

33:23.250 --> 33:25.960
Twice failed. Unforgivable.

33:26.200 --> 33:30.320
I cast another line onto your
neck but you didn't notice.

33:30.320 --> 33:33.380
In the end,
just a foolish amateur.

33:51.740 --> 33:53.840
Idiot! There's still time
to suck the poison out!

33:55.240 --> 33:58.340
Poison doesn't work on me.
My body's immune to it.

34:00.850 --> 34:02.600
I think I've cleared
my debt to you.

34:03.390 --> 34:05.640
Yes. You saved me.

34:06.380 --> 34:10.380
Your name's Kagero, right?
What are you going to do now?

34:10.610 --> 34:12.860
That's none of your concern.

34:13.860 --> 34:16.110
If it isn't, then what
the hell am I doing here?!

34:17.390 --> 34:19.870
I have to discover
their plan.

34:20.670 --> 34:22.970
By yourself? Impossible!

34:22.970 --> 34:25.120
They're too strong.
Think this over.

34:25.630 --> 34:27.290
Stay out of my way.

34:27.290 --> 34:30.710
I've no reason to
take orders from you.

34:33.960 --> 34:36.420
Hold a moment,
ninja woman of the Koga.

34:36.420 --> 34:41.530
My name is Dakuan.
Why don't you join me?

34:41.530 --> 34:45.470
This man is my
trustworthy assistant.

34:45.470 --> 34:48.290
I wasn't planning on
helping a government spy.

34:48.290 --> 34:50.420
Oh, stop complaining!

34:50.420 --> 34:51.480
What do you say, woman?

34:52.020 --> 34:56.420
Our aims may differ, but we
three share a common enemy.

34:56.420 --> 34:59.440
And three is mightier than one.

34:59.440 --> 35:02.950
And I happen to have some
information...

35:02.950 --> 35:05.930
Such as who is giving
them their orders.

35:05.930 --> 35:08.120
I'll tell you on the way.

35:11.870 --> 35:13.130
I need no friends.

35:13.500 --> 35:17.110
But I may need
your information.

35:17.680 --> 35:18.990
Very well.

35:25.300 --> 35:30.050
My, she's a lovely, sexy
little thing, isn't she!

35:30.470 --> 35:33.270
What's running through
that twisted skull of yours?

35:33.740 --> 35:37.450
Well now, that ninja girl
could prove very useful.

35:37.450 --> 35:41.280
She has a technique to poison
the man she sleeps with.

35:41.860 --> 35:46.790
The big guy you killed
had been poisoned by her.

35:52.380 --> 35:55.210
Anyone who makes
love to her dies.

35:55.450 --> 36:00.300
A perfect woman for
this hellish world.

36:41.840 --> 36:44.630
Your skill is as
marvellous as ever.

36:44.630 --> 36:48.040
No... He was able to kill
a mighty ninja like Tessai.

36:48.040 --> 36:52.400
Don't be caught off guard.
It's possible he got away.

36:52.660 --> 36:54.770
The four of you
will check it out.

36:54.770 --> 36:56.720
You're a cautious one,
Yurimaru.

36:57.240 --> 37:02.540
We have an important mission.
We take every precaution.

37:02.540 --> 37:04.360
I know, I know. Don't worry.

37:04.900 --> 37:06.180
Then go.

37:09.330 --> 37:13.830
Yurimaru, Benisato's death...
How fortunate for you!

37:23.130 --> 37:25.370
The only things he
killed were the fish.

37:25.370 --> 37:27.950
Good. Otherwise we
wouldn't get our chance.

37:27.950 --> 37:30.160
It's getting quite
interesting, isn't it?

37:45.070 --> 37:48.410
How is it?
Just as we thought?

37:48.820 --> 37:52.120
They poisoned the wells
and killed the villagers.

37:52.120 --> 37:54.080
And then blamed it
on an epidemic.

37:54.690 --> 37:58.080
A trick to keep
the villagers away.

37:58.740 --> 38:03.440
They're planning something...
very extraordinary.

38:14.470 --> 38:17.350
I'd like to
know what it is.

38:17.600 --> 38:20.750
That's fine, just don't get
yourself involved too deeply.

38:20.750 --> 38:22.540
It could prove fatal.

38:43.820 --> 38:46.340
I see. Guide the others.

39:03.750 --> 39:04.790
Run for it!

39:27.330 --> 39:28.670
We can't outrun them.

39:31.580 --> 39:32.260
Kagero...

39:50.720 --> 39:53.300
So, the pollen is mixed
with a sleeping potion.

39:53.300 --> 39:55.450
But how long will
it hold them back?

39:56.270 --> 39:56.790
Why, you...!

39:58.720 --> 39:59.450
Girl!

39:59.450 --> 40:01.980
You have to hold them off
until Jubei kills him!

40:01.980 --> 40:03.890
Do whatever it takes!

40:18.220 --> 40:20.060
Call off your wasps!

40:20.880 --> 40:23.740
I'm afraid you
must beat me first.

40:25.720 --> 40:27.830
You don't know
anything, do you?

40:27.830 --> 40:31.070
Do you think I ran
in here to escape you?

40:31.070 --> 40:32.340
No, I don't.

40:32.340 --> 40:35.020
I have lots of questions for
you but no time to ask them.

40:35.440 --> 40:39.080
No, just one thing.
Tell me, is Himuro Genma alive?

40:39.080 --> 40:40.890
So what if he is?

40:40.890 --> 40:43.700
Because I sent
him to hell before.

40:43.700 --> 40:46.540
Is that so?
Then I'll have to be careful.

40:46.540 --> 40:51.090
Unlike Genma, I don't have the
technique to reincarnate myself.

40:51.340 --> 40:52.760
Reincarnation?

41:01.400 --> 41:03.960
Fool! You've
damaged the hive!

41:20.490 --> 41:23.480
The second you come up for air
is the second you die!

41:26.190 --> 41:29.690
He's mine!
Keep your hands off him!

41:29.690 --> 41:31.180
What about the ninja
girl and the monk?

41:31.490 --> 41:35.680
My wasps should
finish them off soon.

41:44.680 --> 41:48.690
How far is he trying to run?
What a poor loser!

42:03.370 --> 42:06.460
Do you think he's fallen
victim to the throat needle?

42:16.790 --> 42:21.430
No... The wasps in the hive
are trying to escape the water.

42:21.430 --> 42:26.180
Desperately stinging his body
as they do so... Mushizo's lost.

42:37.510 --> 42:40.120
Took his time about it,
but he finally killed him.

42:54.370 --> 43:00.640
Reincarnation? Did he mean
Himuro Genma's come back to life?

43:01.140 --> 43:02.600
Impossible!

43:15.990 --> 43:20.740
Reincarnation?
I've heard about the technique.

43:21.130 --> 43:26.320
You must control your flesh and
blood down to the tiniest bones.

43:26.320 --> 43:29.680
If your limbs or even
your head were cut off...

43:29.680 --> 43:32.470
...you'd be able to rejoin them.

43:32.470 --> 43:35.740
Reincarnation...
That's a technique of immortality.

43:35.740 --> 43:37.840
It can never be achieved
by a human being.

43:38.300 --> 43:41.000
Well, well...
That's a hell of a trick!

43:41.000 --> 43:45.380
Anyway, the Kimon monsters
are now all after you.

43:45.380 --> 43:48.140
That means I can move easily.

43:50.690 --> 43:53.350
If you're lucky,
we'll meet again.

43:55.930 --> 43:58.140
Why did you join him?

43:58.920 --> 44:01.920
He hired me...
For 100 gold pieces.

44:02.200 --> 44:05.200
You're a mercenary ninja?
One who'd do anything for money?

44:06.170 --> 44:07.350
You could say that.

44:07.920 --> 44:12.650
But he suckered me
into it. Trapped me.

44:12.650 --> 44:15.460
I'll die of his poison
in half a day.

44:16.720 --> 44:20.250
He promised me an antidote
along with the gold.

44:20.510 --> 44:24.670
That's why I work for him.
I can't back out now.

44:24.980 --> 44:27.970
You'd better run for it
while I divert their attention.

44:28.800 --> 44:31.940
I can't do that.
I'd owe you another debt.

44:32.400 --> 44:34.030
Forget about any debts.

44:34.030 --> 44:36.810
And I told you I don't
have to take orders from you.

44:37.300 --> 44:39.860
Besides, I'm ready
to die any moment.

44:39.860 --> 44:41.950
Relax. Stop pretending
you're so tough.

44:41.950 --> 44:43.150
What?!

44:44.600 --> 44:46.720
It's this humid weather!

44:46.950 --> 44:51.350
I wish a storm would come and
cool off that hot head of yours.

44:55.550 --> 44:57.630
You're in no position
to worry about me.

45:04.160 --> 45:05.150
Storm...

45:07.390 --> 45:11.790
They came on the night
of that big storm...

45:16.220 --> 45:19.150
Hey, where can I get a
good look at this area?

45:25.680 --> 45:27.020
How about there?

45:27.020 --> 45:28.090
Nothing.

45:28.810 --> 45:30.070
Keep looking!

45:42.950 --> 45:43.590
Hanza...

45:44.110 --> 45:45.510
Wait!

45:45.510 --> 45:47.220
Hanza!

45:51.400 --> 45:54.500
There's a cliff
in front of you! Stop!

45:55.140 --> 45:56.190
Damn...!

46:10.030 --> 46:11.030
Gotcha!

46:11.320 --> 46:12.040
Shit!

46:20.250 --> 46:25.130
Fool! They got you so soon?
We still had a lot to do.

46:29.780 --> 46:32.930
The scent of blasted flesh,
grilled to perfection...

46:32.930 --> 46:34.960
Such a lovely smell.

46:58.890 --> 47:00.880
Don't... move...

47:00.880 --> 47:03.350
That's enough. Let me go.

47:03.350 --> 47:05.380
It's my fault I fell for their trap.

47:05.670 --> 47:08.130
Shut up! Don't talk!

47:08.380 --> 47:10.890
Let go of me!
I don't want your help.

47:10.890 --> 47:12.890
Shut up...

47:20.900 --> 47:23.350
Go on, grab it!

47:35.990 --> 47:38.160
Just gonna hang
onto me all day?

47:55.930 --> 48:00.940
I am Utsutsu Mujuro.
I've been longing to challenge you.

48:07.210 --> 48:09.690
He's here for me.
Stay here.

48:22.250 --> 48:27.420
You lured me here because I'm blind?
Is that your plan?

48:41.060 --> 48:44.060
If you want to kill me,
then don't make a sound.

48:45.100 --> 48:49.070
That's impossible. But maybe I can
turn your skill to my advantage.

49:27.870 --> 49:29.520
I told you to stay back!

49:36.330 --> 49:38.240
Your sight is your weakness.

49:42.080 --> 49:43.080
Outta the way!

49:55.540 --> 49:56.840
Impossible...

50:20.020 --> 50:22.450
Would you give it a rest?!
What the hell were you thinking?!

50:24.390 --> 50:26.460
What are you
so obsessed about?

50:26.770 --> 50:30.630
Shut up! You're the one obsessed
with repaying me for saving you!

50:31.020 --> 50:34.240
You act like you've got
some kind of death wish!

50:35.210 --> 50:36.980
Is it because of your body?

50:40.600 --> 50:44.680
Is it true the men you sleep
with die from the poison?

50:50.280 --> 50:52.230
Embrace me
and you'll find out.

50:57.940 --> 50:59.240
Idiot!

50:59.480 --> 51:02.120
My body is saturated with poison.

51:02.120 --> 51:06.150
It's so strong that a touch of
my lips will kill instantly.

51:07.310 --> 51:12.450
No one can touch me.
Anyone who dares to... dies.

51:13.100 --> 51:15.450
Did the poison twist
your heart, too?

51:15.880 --> 51:16.910
How dare you!

51:23.800 --> 51:26.770
I hate people who don't
value their own lives.

51:45.630 --> 51:48.970
You've no idea...
You couldn't understand!

52:29.930 --> 52:32.810
The cargo from the ship that ran
aground in the storm two days ago.

52:33.070 --> 52:34.690
That's what they're after.

52:35.340 --> 52:38.380
They butchered the villagers
like animals for it.

52:52.290 --> 52:54.170
Where does this road lead?

53:00.800 --> 53:01.800
Chamberlain!

53:02.780 --> 53:06.030
Lord Hyobu, is it true?
That the Koga ninja who...

53:06.030 --> 53:09.730
...went to investigate Shimoda
Village were wiped out?

53:09.730 --> 53:10.790
Exactly.

53:11.260 --> 53:15.050
But how...?!
This is an emergency.

53:15.050 --> 53:17.440
I'll take my men to the
village immediately.

53:17.440 --> 53:17.790
No!

53:18.590 --> 53:23.140
If this is serious
enough to jeopardise...

53:23.140 --> 53:25.440
...the safety of our clan,
we must move very carefully.

53:26.030 --> 53:28.300
That's how small clans
like ours can survive.

53:28.580 --> 53:29.560
But...

53:29.890 --> 53:33.640
The ninja woman who survived
is continuing the investigation.

53:33.640 --> 53:35.560
Wait for her report.

53:49.440 --> 53:51.800
You're tired from being
tensed up all the time.

53:51.800 --> 53:53.210
Get some more sleep.

54:45.310 --> 54:48.440
Those wheel tracks lead
to Kashima Harbour.

54:48.990 --> 54:51.220
They're probably going to
transport the cargo out by boat.

54:51.920 --> 54:53.310
If I don't stop them...

54:53.310 --> 54:56.520
...the dead villagers and Koga
ninja will never rest in peace.

54:58.990 --> 55:02.300
I'll cooperate with you
till the mission's over.

55:02.300 --> 55:06.440
But if you insult me again,
I'll kill you where you stand!

55:21.490 --> 55:25.660
Listen well, you who labour
for the Shogun of the Dark.

55:25.660 --> 55:29.520
This mission could very
well decide our fate!

55:29.520 --> 55:32.140
This ship will reach the
Mochizuki domain in a few hours.

55:32.620 --> 55:36.070
We must retrieve the
cargo at any cost!

55:36.070 --> 55:38.550
Understood? At any cost!

55:58.170 --> 56:00.800
The townsmen must have departed
out of fear of the epidemic.

56:01.500 --> 56:04.780
One horse was enough
to scare them all away.

56:09.180 --> 56:12.430
So, you're still alive.
I've been worried.

56:13.280 --> 56:15.430
It's nice to see you, too.

56:15.430 --> 56:19.160
They're waiting for a boat
to transport the cargo.

56:19.420 --> 56:21.570
Did you check
what the cargo is?

56:21.570 --> 56:26.410
No, I couldn't reach it.
But I can guess what it is.

56:26.410 --> 56:28.440
Actually, I guessed before
I came here to Mochizuki.

56:28.980 --> 56:30.020
What?!

56:30.020 --> 56:31.570
You haven't figured it out?

56:32.230 --> 56:34.950
It's something that has
to do with your past.

56:35.670 --> 56:41.460
It's gold, boy. Gold produced
from that secret Yamashiro mine.

56:42.960 --> 56:45.430
The ship ran aground
during the storm...

56:45.430 --> 56:49.740
Probably on its way to the Shogun
of the Dark with caskets of gold.

56:49.740 --> 56:54.290
Gold that's probably been
hidden for the last five years.

56:54.290 --> 56:56.560
If it reaches his hands,
he'll be powerful enough...

56:56.560 --> 56:59.200
...to topple the
Tokugawa government...

56:59.200 --> 57:01.560
...and plunge the country
into another civil war.

57:01.560 --> 57:03.960
We have to stop it at any cost!

57:07.950 --> 57:10.870
Dakuan, you've got a tail.

57:10.870 --> 57:11.400
What?!

57:22.040 --> 57:23.670
Girl, what are you doing?!

57:24.130 --> 57:27.840
I'm calling a Koga ninja bird
that's in this village.

57:28.170 --> 57:29.750
Calling a bird? What for?

57:30.180 --> 57:32.640
It'll carry my message
to the castle chamberlain.

57:32.960 --> 57:35.020
I've discovered
what they're after.

57:35.020 --> 57:39.060
In two hours, his army
will surround the town.

57:39.060 --> 57:41.130
It's not as easy as you think.

57:41.130 --> 57:44.260
The Mochizuki clan will probably
ignore this whole thing.

57:44.700 --> 57:45.270
Why?!

57:49.980 --> 57:51.850
The future of
the clan is at stake.

57:51.850 --> 57:55.070
This is a power struggle between the
Tokugawa and the Shogun of the Dark.

57:55.070 --> 57:59.120
If a small clan like the Mochizuki
got involved, it'd be smashed!

58:02.110 --> 58:05.980
See nothing, hear nothing.
That's the best course for the clan.

58:17.490 --> 58:20.350
We'll find out soon whether or
not the Mochizuki will move.

58:30.030 --> 58:32.000
So, now what are
you playing at?

58:32.450 --> 58:36.820
The man you hired is going
to die from your poison.

58:36.820 --> 58:38.690
Tell me how to save him.

58:39.010 --> 58:44.200
Amazing! You've fallen in
love with Jubei, haven't you?

58:45.630 --> 58:49.450
Fool! I'm only doing it
to clear my debt with him!

58:49.450 --> 58:51.960
I don't think so.

58:52.560 --> 58:56.220
A ninja woman falling in love!
What's the point?

58:58.780 --> 59:01.650
If you kill me,
there'll be no saving him.

59:01.650 --> 59:05.770
Yes, and your mission
will be a failure.

59:21.480 --> 59:21.990
Shit!

59:23.420 --> 59:24.410
Uh-oh!

59:25.260 --> 59:29.330
Calm down!
That's the real cure for him.

59:29.330 --> 59:32.290
If you want to save his life,
there's no other way.

59:32.290 --> 59:34.660
It's up to you.

1:00:02.620 --> 1:00:07.160
It must have happened when
I went off for a moment.

1:00:08.630 --> 1:00:11.640
She's most likely dead.

1:00:12.500 --> 1:00:15.630
Well, we've got work to do.

1:00:15.630 --> 1:00:18.260
We'll get no help
from the Mochizuki clan.

1:00:21.770 --> 1:00:24.120
Don't fall for their trap.

1:00:24.680 --> 1:00:25.260
Wait!

1:00:26.630 --> 1:00:29.260
What if their ship comes
while you're at it?

1:00:29.260 --> 1:00:32.770
Leave her alone! A dead ninja
girl isn't that important!

1:00:33.650 --> 1:00:35.660
Not important compared
to the great mission?

1:00:35.660 --> 1:00:37.650
You're as much of
a monster as they are!

1:00:37.650 --> 1:00:40.230
Fool! When you fight monsters...

1:00:40.230 --> 1:00:43.160
...you become one yourself
or you can't win.

1:00:43.660 --> 1:00:48.370
You damn fool boy!
Go ahead! Go to hell!

1:00:48.370 --> 1:00:51.660
You God damned...

1:01:53.290 --> 1:01:54.060
Are you alright?

1:01:56.630 --> 1:01:57.150
Kagero!

1:02:16.580 --> 1:02:20.590
You're hard to kill, but...
Woman, release his pain.

1:02:43.540 --> 1:02:46.040
Kibagami Jubei?

1:02:46.040 --> 1:02:49.120
Yes. But we've already
killed them all.

1:02:49.120 --> 1:02:51.830
Idiot! They still live.

1:02:53.170 --> 1:02:54.660
I'll kill him, for sure!

1:02:54.660 --> 1:02:59.120
Stay where you are.
Lure them there and kill them.

1:02:59.350 --> 1:03:00.560
Understand?

1:03:00.560 --> 1:03:01.090
Yes.

1:03:07.230 --> 1:03:09.920
Never would I have
imagined to see him here.

1:03:09.920 --> 1:03:12.600
I look forward to
seeing you again, Jubei.

1:03:14.250 --> 1:03:15.270
Genma!

1:03:20.690 --> 1:03:21.860
I'm sorry.

1:03:22.950 --> 1:03:27.070
Forget it. I take it the castle
retainers haven't taken any action?

1:03:28.630 --> 1:03:30.710
It's been two hours.

1:03:31.580 --> 1:03:32.660
I see.

1:03:36.880 --> 1:03:40.600
Why... You knew it was a trap,
but you came to help me.

1:03:40.600 --> 1:03:44.040
It was stupid.
Why risk your life for me?

1:03:44.040 --> 1:03:45.640
Because you're my comrade.

1:03:46.150 --> 1:03:47.090
Comrade?

1:03:47.480 --> 1:03:51.850
Yes. We've saved each other
over and over since yesterday.

1:03:51.850 --> 1:03:53.100
You're a precious
friend to me.

1:04:02.320 --> 1:04:03.110
Stay!

1:04:03.700 --> 1:04:06.280
The Mochizuki clan
is sitting this one out.

1:04:06.280 --> 1:04:08.110
Your mission is over.

1:04:08.500 --> 1:04:12.110
No, it isn't.
I'm still in debt to you.

1:04:13.700 --> 1:04:15.370
You can pay it back later.

1:04:16.240 --> 1:04:18.310
Not if you're dead!

1:04:18.310 --> 1:04:20.370
I'll repay it here!

1:04:30.210 --> 1:04:31.600
What are you doing?

1:04:38.170 --> 1:04:41.690
The old man told me how
to counteract the poison.

1:04:42.890 --> 1:04:44.680
"Kill poison with poison".

1:04:45.050 --> 1:04:49.490
He said if you make love
to me, you'll be cured.

1:04:51.950 --> 1:04:53.740
Take me...

1:05:48.740 --> 1:05:51.590
Why?!
You'll die if you don't!

1:05:52.320 --> 1:05:54.590
Why...? Jubei!

1:06:25.250 --> 1:06:28.250
We've been waiting!
Load the ship immediately!

1:06:54.130 --> 1:06:56.200
You! Well,
I warned you, didn't I?

1:06:57.170 --> 1:07:01.490
We're screwed.
We'll never beat that many men.

1:07:01.980 --> 1:07:06.500
I don't intend to let them go.
We'll make our stand soon.

1:07:06.880 --> 1:07:08.280
What are you planning?

1:07:08.280 --> 1:07:11.180
When they finish loading
the gold onto the ship...

1:07:11.180 --> 1:07:13.310
...go to the tower
and ring the bell.

1:07:13.310 --> 1:07:16.740
While they're distracted,
I'll sneak onboard the ship.

1:07:16.740 --> 1:07:19.710
When we're out at sea,
we won't need any storm.

1:07:19.710 --> 1:07:21.600
I'll sink it myself.

1:07:21.600 --> 1:07:22.510
Very well.

1:07:23.330 --> 1:07:27.400
By the way, did you make
love to the ninja girl?

1:07:28.540 --> 1:07:32.700
None of your damn business!
Now get going!

1:07:54.620 --> 1:07:56.860
Genma... Where are you?

1:07:57.520 --> 1:08:00.930
When I die, I'll take
you to hell with me!

1:08:32.990 --> 1:08:35.540
The Mochizuki clan?!
They're moving against them!

1:08:40.890 --> 1:08:43.010
Ah, Kagero!
You've done a fine job.

1:08:43.370 --> 1:08:46.510
Hurry, before they get away!
Where are the others?

1:08:46.930 --> 1:08:50.020
Don't worry. They've
got this place surrounded.

1:08:50.270 --> 1:08:52.210
Then hurry!

1:09:10.580 --> 1:09:12.080
Jubei...

1:09:20.490 --> 1:09:21.620
Kagero!

1:09:23.290 --> 1:09:25.090
Stop! It's a trap!

1:09:25.510 --> 1:09:30.100
Fools! Sakaki Hyobu
died two days ago.

1:09:44.090 --> 1:09:46.110
I killed him personally.

1:09:46.110 --> 1:09:49.390
Genma!

1:10:16.130 --> 1:10:19.460
Sir, please get
aboard the ship quickly.

1:10:19.460 --> 1:10:23.240
The retainers of the
Shogun of the Dark are waiting.

1:10:23.990 --> 1:10:28.240
Leave Jubei to me.
Upon my honour, I will not fail.

1:10:29.190 --> 1:10:32.530
Please grant me
this one wish.

1:10:36.770 --> 1:10:38.750
Very well then. Go.

1:11:06.520 --> 1:11:10.440
Stay out of this. Don't shame me
any more than you already have.

1:11:13.000 --> 1:11:14.790
So, you are Genma?

1:11:15.160 --> 1:11:18.740
The Mochizuki clan
suspect nothing, correct?

1:11:18.740 --> 1:11:20.790
Yes. All is well.

1:11:21.480 --> 1:11:25.170
You've done a splendid job.
I admire you Devils of Kimon.

1:11:25.170 --> 1:11:28.300
The Shogun of the Dark
will be pleased.

1:12:01.420 --> 1:12:03.790
Writhe in pain before you die.

1:12:39.390 --> 1:12:42.470
Yurimaru seems to have
suffered some ill fortune!

1:12:42.470 --> 1:12:46.420
How careless of him
to have fallen into my trap.

1:12:47.310 --> 1:12:49.850
It was your own fault,
Yurimaru.

1:12:53.550 --> 1:12:54.930
Let's go.

1:12:57.690 --> 1:12:58.850
Kagero!

1:13:08.360 --> 1:13:10.780
Hang on! Kagero!

1:13:14.580 --> 1:13:15.780
Jubei...

1:13:16.320 --> 1:13:17.780
I told you not to come.

1:13:19.160 --> 1:13:22.790
I wanted... to apologise...

1:13:26.300 --> 1:13:28.120
It was the first time...

1:13:28.660 --> 1:13:32.390
You didn't treat
me like a ninja woman...

1:13:32.390 --> 1:13:36.300
...but like
a normal woman.

1:13:36.660 --> 1:13:40.290
I knew I was becoming attracted
to you, and I was afraid.

1:13:40.630 --> 1:13:44.810
So I tried to push you away.
Forgive me...

1:13:47.460 --> 1:13:51.320
I don't care what
you think of me!

1:13:52.280 --> 1:13:56.820
If for an antidote...or out
of pity... I don't care...

1:13:57.500 --> 1:14:01.040
I just wish... that
you'd made love to me.

1:14:07.980 --> 1:14:12.240
I was stupid... and weak.

1:14:12.240 --> 1:14:15.510
Why couldn't I have
been more honest?

1:14:15.860 --> 1:14:19.510
Enough.
Don't say any more...

1:15:08.130 --> 1:15:13.660
Jubei...
I'm glad... I met you...

1:16:48.130 --> 1:16:53.830
Genma, with the gold's help
our dream will soon be reality.

1:16:53.830 --> 1:16:54.850
"Our" dream?

1:16:54.850 --> 1:16:58.590
Our great dream to
topple the Shogunate...

1:16:58.590 --> 1:17:01.040
...and restore the reign
of the House of Toyotomi.

1:17:01.040 --> 1:17:02.960
You don't understand...

1:17:02.960 --> 1:17:06.680
How we, the former retainers
of Toyotomi, have suffered.

1:17:06.680 --> 1:17:10.380
Now it'll be the Tokugawa who
suffer the agony and torment.

1:17:10.380 --> 1:17:13.910
We'll use the gold to buy the
most advanced weapons from Spain...

1:17:13.910 --> 1:17:15.850
...and defeat the
Tokugawa government.

1:17:16.200 --> 1:17:20.690
That is the dream of all of us who
work for the Shogun of the Dark.

1:17:21.450 --> 1:17:22.700
Nonsense.

1:17:24.370 --> 1:17:25.700
What did you say?!

1:17:25.700 --> 1:17:27.470
I said nonsense.

1:17:27.470 --> 1:17:30.820
Hold your tongue!
You're a mere ninja!

1:17:30.820 --> 1:17:32.610
My dream is different.

1:17:32.610 --> 1:17:35.720
The gold isn't going
to the Shogun of the Dark.

1:17:35.720 --> 1:17:36.420
What?!

1:17:36.420 --> 1:17:38.730
We, the Devils of Kimon,
will take the gold.

1:17:38.730 --> 1:17:40.300
You impudent...

1:17:42.390 --> 1:17:46.600
I'll use it to organise the most
powerful army of ninja ever.

1:17:46.600 --> 1:17:51.600
And we'll rule the country with
terror and power from the shadows.

1:17:51.600 --> 1:17:54.980
Anyone who opposes me,
Tokugawa or Toyotomi...

1:17:54.980 --> 1:17:57.710
...even the Shogun of the Dark
himself, shall die.

1:17:59.010 --> 1:18:02.940
Meaning the true Shogun
of the Dark...will be me.

1:18:20.480 --> 1:18:26.420
Well now, you're here!
I was just wishing you'd come.

1:18:26.420 --> 1:18:27.510
I'm glad to hear that.

1:18:28.070 --> 1:18:29.600
Of course.

1:18:29.600 --> 1:18:33.020
Without your help, sinking
a big ship like this...

1:18:34.110 --> 1:18:35.590
...would be impossible!

1:18:41.470 --> 1:18:42.650
Pathetic old fool!

1:18:44.270 --> 1:18:45.150
Over here.

1:18:55.900 --> 1:18:56.870
What's wrong?

1:18:57.660 --> 1:19:00.650
Fire in the hold!
We're gonna sink!

1:19:00.650 --> 1:19:02.660
Idiot!
Put out the fire!

1:19:02.660 --> 1:19:04.790
Impossible!
It's a sea of flames!

1:19:04.790 --> 1:19:07.350
Put it out! Fight it!

1:19:07.350 --> 1:19:09.890
Move it! Move it!

1:19:09.890 --> 1:19:12.390
Forget it! Run!

1:19:20.430 --> 1:19:21.150
Master Genma!

1:19:22.230 --> 1:19:23.670
Pass this message to everyone:

1:19:23.880 --> 1:19:29.000
"Abandon ship and hide yourselves.
I’ll call for you someday".

1:19:29.000 --> 1:19:29.990
Go.

1:20:09.560 --> 1:20:10.530
Genma!

1:20:12.960 --> 1:20:16.260
I see you brought back some
devils from your trip to hell.

1:20:25.090 --> 1:20:26.650
Kibagami Jubei...

1:20:26.940 --> 1:20:30.380
I should've finished you
with my own hands.

1:20:30.730 --> 1:20:33.430
Stop whining.
It's too late.

1:20:35.200 --> 1:20:38.360
You want to avenge
the ninja girl Kagero?

1:20:38.970 --> 1:20:42.150
She was trash in comparison
to what I've lost.

1:20:46.020 --> 1:20:48.150
You alone I can't forgive!

1:21:41.460 --> 1:21:45.220
I won't kill you yet.
Not before I make you suffer.

1:21:45.220 --> 1:21:47.420
I'll make you pay
for smashing my dream.

1:21:47.730 --> 1:21:52.420
Your dream? That you were going
to be the true Shogun of the Dark?

1:21:53.200 --> 1:21:54.930
Don't make me laugh.

1:21:55.460 --> 1:22:00.430
If you became shogun, you'd
make this a world of devils.

1:22:01.070 --> 1:22:02.930
If you enjoy
their company so much...

1:22:03.300 --> 1:22:05.940
...then go back to hell!

1:22:22.920 --> 1:22:24.620
I'll kill you...!

1:22:27.930 --> 1:22:29.380
No one can kill me.

1:22:34.380 --> 1:22:37.340
You of all people
should know by now...

1:22:40.290 --> 1:22:43.110
I am immortal.

1:22:46.130 --> 1:22:47.780
Is that so?

1:23:02.990 --> 1:23:07.080
If you keep coming
back to life...

1:23:07.080 --> 1:23:11.250
...then I'll kill you as
many times as it takes!

1:24:22.570 --> 1:24:25.240
You fool!

1:25:13.440 --> 1:25:16.540
Genma! Here you die!

1:26:14.790 --> 1:26:16.040
Jubei!

1:26:16.260 --> 1:26:20.990
You seem to be rid of the
poison, thanks to Kagero.

1:26:20.990 --> 1:26:24.150
The combination of a poison-
tasting ninja girl and...

1:26:24.150 --> 1:26:27.780
...a talented lone wolf worked out
even better than I had planned.

1:26:27.780 --> 1:26:28.910
Go away.

1:26:33.700 --> 1:26:38.610
By the way, I'm sorry about
losing Kagero. A real pity, that!

1:26:38.610 --> 1:26:41.500
But for a scant few moments,
she was able to...

1:26:41.500 --> 1:26:45.090
...be an ordinary girl
and to make love with you.

1:26:45.640 --> 1:26:47.900
Was that part
of your plan, too?

1:26:47.900 --> 1:26:50.410
Exactly. To read and
control peoples' hearts...

1:26:50.410 --> 1:26:53.100
...is the true secret
of the ninja.

1:26:54.640 --> 1:26:59.040
Still, only true sincerity
can move the human heart.

1:26:59.370 --> 1:27:01.930
A twisted old bastard
like me couldn't do it.

1:27:02.320 --> 1:27:06.140
You're a hell of a guy.
I really admire you.

1:27:06.140 --> 1:27:09.040
As promised, I'll be waiting in
Edo with your 100 gold pieces.

1:27:09.040 --> 1:27:11.110
Come and get it,
if you're still alive.

1:27:17.870 --> 1:27:21.380
That makes us even.
Now, never cross my path again.

1:27:22.310 --> 1:27:26.100
You've beaten me. I thought I'd
shut your mouth in Edo, but...

1:27:26.100 --> 1:27:30.140
Still, in your condition you likely
won't even make it to the shore.

1:27:30.140 --> 1:27:33.390
Everything will end
just as I planned.

1:28:18.400 --> 1:28:24.190
Come with me, let's go out to see the stars.

1:28:18.400 --> 1:28:24.190
hoshi wo minibika nai ka

1:28:24.700 --> 1:28:30.760
Evening has only just begun.

1:28:24.700 --> 1:28:30.760
yowaru wa hajimatta bakari

1:28:30.810 --> 1:28:37.610
I don't want anything, only for you...

1:28:30.810 --> 1:28:37.610
nani mo iranai kimi ga

1:28:37.610 --> 1:28:44.090
...to be at my side, a smile on your face.

1:28:37.610 --> 1:28:44.090
waratte soba ni iranewai

1:28:44.090 --> 1:28:49.270
A distant summer, the two of us alone...

1:28:44.090 --> 1:28:49.270
tooi natsu kutai de

1:28:49.990 --> 1:28:56.340
Sitting on the beach we used to walk.

1:28:49.990 --> 1:28:56.340
aruita hamabe suwari

1:28:56.340 --> 1:29:02.920
Trying to retrieve the gentleness...

1:28:56.340 --> 1:29:02.920
okizari ni shita yasashisa go

1:29:02.920 --> 1:29:08.250
...that we left behind.

1:29:02.920 --> 1:29:08.250
hiroi atsui yo

1:29:08.950 --> 1:29:15.680
A distant ballad sung to no one at all...

1:29:08.950 --> 1:29:15.680
dare mo ga tooku de baraado

1:29:15.680 --> 1:29:20.910
I can still hear it even now.

1:29:15.680 --> 1:29:20.910
kyou mo kitte iru

1:29:21.380 --> 1:29:27.870
It embraces my wandering heart...

1:29:21.380 --> 1:29:27.870
samayou kokoro wo dakiyoseru

1:29:27.870 --> 1:29:35.670
...just like the cool night wind.

1:29:27.870 --> 1:29:35.670
kaze no you ni

1:29:59.460 --> 1:30:05.080
Looking at you, only you...

1:29:59.460 --> 1:30:05.080
hitori dake mitsume

1:30:05.740 --> 1:30:12.020
...saying things hard for us to say.

1:30:05.740 --> 1:30:12.020
muzukashi samashite iru

1:30:12.020 --> 1:30:18.680
Times may have changed, but I know...

1:30:12.020 --> 1:30:18.680
jidai ga kawatteku you ni

1:30:18.680 --> 1:30:24.080
...my feelings are still the same for you.

1:30:18.680 --> 1:30:24.080
kokoro wa kawananai

1:30:24.890 --> 1:30:31.480
A distant ballad sung to no one at all...

1:30:24.890 --> 1:30:31.480
dare mo ga tooku de baraado

1:30:31.480 --> 1:30:36.950
I can still hear it even now.

1:30:31.480 --> 1:30:36.950
kyou mo kitte iru

1:30:37.400 --> 1:30:43.710
It embraces my wandering heart...

1:30:37.400 --> 1:30:43.710
samayou kokoro wo dakiyoseru

1:30:43.710 --> 1:30:52.120
...just like the cool night wind.

1:30:43.710 --> 1:30:52.120
kaze no you ni
